The ReSTIR story's reservoirs combined
======================================

What the story draws on the canvas (lab/src/math/) for chapter 4's beat `c4-combine-math`, stage by stage as
its stage (`stepOf "combine" 16`, the clips below) goes from 0 to 16: in the math scenes' example world (examples.rs, the lab's illustration), P's
reservoir and a neighbour's, Q's, each of 32 candidates; their kept samples as two new candidates; the weight a
candidate needs, its target over the chance it was drawn, a chance no one recorded, W in its place, the target taken
at P, and M, which gives P's own reservoir back its sum of weights; then P's and its three neighbours' reservoirs
in a table, factor by factor, their weights laid end to end for the pick, the counts added, and W.

$[Import* std]
$[Import* render_lab_runtime]
$[Import* render_lab_math]
$[Import* paper_restir_values]
$[Import* paper_restir_natives]
$[Import* paper_restir_common]

The example

The seed of the reservoirs' candidates, and how many each drew (the paper's thirty-two).
$[# _seed 13]
$[# _count 32]
The reservoirs' names: P's, then its neighbours'.
$[# _names [% {' "P" "Q" "R" "S"}]]
The size of the scene's formulas.
$[# _size 0.44]
Where the weight's formula is worked out, and where it goes once it is done.
$[# _mainAt [% {v2 3.6 1.0}]]
$[# _topAt [% {v2 0.0 3.55}]]
Where the derivation's second line goes.
$[# _belowAt [% {v2 3.6 -0.4}]]

Fn([Int], String). A light's name as LaTeX (the lights counted from 1).
$[# {_light l} f"{\ell_{${str {+ l 1}}}}"]

The two reservoirs

Fn([String, Vec2, String, {light: Int, m: Float, pHat: Float, pHatP: Float, pixel: Int, running: Float, taken: Bool, u: Float, w: Float, weight: Float, wsum: Float}], List(Mob)).
A reservoir's record at `at`: its title, and the sample it kept, its W, and its count, each captioned, named
`<id>Kept`, `<id>W`, `<id>M`.
$[# {_card id at title src}
    [# xs {' -1.5 0.0 1.5}]
    [# values {' {_light {.light src}} {short {.w src}} {str {round {.m src}}}}]
    [# names {' "Kept" "W" "M"}]
    [# colors {' targetColor estimateColor textColor}]
    [# captions {'
        {textKey "combinemath-kept"}
        {textKey "combinemath-w"}
        {textKey "combinemath-count"}}]
    {flatten {'
        {moveTo {caption {++ id "Title"} title 0.32 textDimColor} {add2 at {v2 0.0 1.35}}}
        {outlined
            {++ id "Box"}
            {box {sub2 at {v2 2.3 0.5}} {add2 at {v2 2.3 0.5}}}
            textDimColor
            2.0}
        {flatten {map
            {range 0 3}
            {^ {k}
                [# c {add2 at {v2 {nth xs k} 0.0}}]
                {append
                    {moveTo
                        {caption {++ id {++ "Cap" {str k}}} {nth captions k} 0.32 textDimColor}
                        {add2 c {v2 0.0 0.8}}}
                    {moveTo
                        {tex {++ id {nth names k}} {nth values k} _size {nth colors k}}
                        c}}}}}}}]

Fn([Int, Float], List(Mob)). The weight's formula as it is built (`v` 1: the target over the chance; 2: W in the
chance's place; 3: the target at P; 4: times M), its parts named `pHat`, `p`, `W`, and `M`, at `at`.
$[# {_weight v at}
    [# latex {!if {= v 1}
        f"{w = \frac{\lit{1}{\hat p(y)}}{\lit{2}{p(y)}}}"
        {!if {= v 2}
            f"{w = \lit{1}{\hat p(y)} \cdot \lit{2}{W}}"
            {!if {= v 3}
                f"{w = \lit{1}{\hat p_P(y)} \cdot \lit{2}{W}}"
                f"{w = \lit{1}{\hat p_P(y)} \cdot \lit{2}{W} \cdot \lit{3}{M}}"}}}]
    [# names {!if {= v 1} {' "pHat" "p"} {' "pHat" "W" "M"}}]
    [# colors {!if {= v 1} {' targetColor pColor} {' targetColor estimateColor textColor}}]
    {moveTo {texParts "weight" latex 0.52 weightColor names colors} at}]

Fn([], List(Mob)). The weight's formula moved to the top, where it waits while the reservoirs are combined.
$[# {_weightAtTop} {_weight 4 _topAt}]

Fn([{kept: Int, m: Float, sources: List({light: Int, m: Float, pHat: Float, pHatP: Float, pixel: Int, running: Float, taken: Bool, u: Float, w: Float, weight: Float, wsum: Float}), w: Float, wsum: Float}], List(ScorePart)).
The derivation (stages 1 to 10): the two reservoirs and their samples flying out as two new candidates; the weight's
formula written, its chance pointed at and struck out, W in its place, the target at P, and M; under it the chance
named, W on average one over it (with the worked example's numbers), the neighbour's sample's target at Q and at P,
and P's own weight back as its sum of weights. All but the formula leave at stage 11.
$[# {_derivationParts c}
    [# p {nth {.sources c} 0}]
    [# q {nth {.sources c} 1}]
    [# k {toyKept 1}]
    [# {_point ids} {^ {t f} {pointParts t f ids accentColor}}]
    [# cards {append
        {_card "cardP" {v2 -4.4 2.2} {textKey "combinemath-res-p"} p}
        {_card "cardQ" {v2 -4.4 -0.3} {textKey "combinemath-res-q"} q}}]
    [# chipP {moveTo
        {texParts "chipP" f"{y_P = \lit{1}{${_light {.light p}}}}" _size textColor
            {' "chipPv"}
            {' targetColor}}
        {v2 -1.0 2.2}}]
    [# chipQ {moveTo
        {texParts "chipQ" f"{y_Q = \lit{1}{${_light {.light q}}}}" _size textColor
            {' "chipQv"}
            {' targetColor}}
        {v2 -1.0 -0.3}}]
    [# chance {moveTo {caption "chance" {textKey "combinemath-chance"} 0.32 pColor} _belowAt}]
    [# mean {moveTo
        {texParts "mean" f"{\lit{1}{\overline{W}} = \frac{1}{\lit{2}{p(y)}}}" _size textColor
            {' "W" "p"}
            {' estimateColor pColor}}
        _belowAt}]
    [# example {append
        {moveTo
            {caption "exampleNote" {textKey "combinemath-example"} 0.32 textDimColor}
            {add2 _belowAt {v2 0.0 -1.15}}}
        {moveTo
            {tex "example" f"{\overline{W}_B = \frac{1}{${numberLatex {.chance k} 1}} = ${numberLatex {.w k} 1}}" 0.42
                textColor}
            {add2 _belowAt {v2 0.0 -2.0}}}}]
    [# atP {append
        {moveTo
            {tex "atQ" f"{\hat p_Q(${_light {.light q}}) = ${short {.pHat q}}}" _size textColor}
            _belowAt}
        {moveTo
            {texParts "atP" f"{\lit{1}{\hat p_P(${_light {.light q}}) = ${short {.pHatP q}}}}" _size textColor
                {' "pP"}
                {' targetColor}}
            {add2 _belowAt {v2 0.0 -0.9}}}}]
    [# own {append
        {moveTo
            {texParts "own" f"{\hat p_P(y_P) \cdot W_P \cdot \lit{1}{M_P}}" _size textColor
                {' "M"}
                {' textColor}}
            _belowAt}
        {moveTo
            {texParts "ownV" f"{= ${short {.pHatP p}} \cdot ${short {.w p}} \cdot \lit{1}{${str {round {.m p}}}} = \lit{2}{${short {.weight p}}}}" _size textColor
                {' "Mv" "v"}
                {' textColor weightColor}}
            {add2 _belowAt {v2 0.0 -0.9}}}}]
    [# sum {moveTo
        {texParts "ownSum" f"{\sum_{P} w_i = \lit{1}{${short {.wsum p}}}}" _size textColor
            {' "v"}
            {' weightColor}}
        {add2 _belowAt {v2 0.0 -1.9}}}]
    [# {_still fig} {^ {s} fig}]
    [# {_leaves at} {exitOver at 0.3 fadeOut}]
    {'
        {part "cards"
            {_still cards}
            {'
                {emphasize 5.0 6.0 {_point {' "cardQW"}}}
                {emphasize 7.0 7.8 {_point {' "cardPW"}}}
                {emphasize 8.0 9.0 {_point {' "cardPM"}}}
                {_leaves 10.0}}}
        {part "chipP"
            {_still chipP}
            {'
                {enterOver 0.4 0.4 {^ {t f} {fromCopy t {withId cards "cardPKept"} f}}}
                {_leaves 10.0}}}
        {part "chipQ"
            {_still chipQ}
            {'
                {enterOver 0.6 0.4 {^ {t f} {fromCopy t {withId cards "cardQKept"} f}}}
                {_leaves 10.0}}}
        {part "weight"
            {_still {_weight 1 _mainAt}}
            {'
                {enterOver 1.0 0.8 write}
                {emphasize 2.0 3.0 {_point {' "p"}}}
                {hold 3.0 5.0 {^ {t f} {crossParts t f {' "p"} accentColor}}}
                {becomeOver 5.0 0.8 {_still {_weight 2 _mainAt}}}
                {becomeOver 6.0 0.6 {_still {_weight 3 _mainAt}}}
                {becomeOver 9.0 0.9 {_still {_weight 4 _mainAt}}}
                {becomeOver 10.0 0.4 {_still {_weightAtTop}}}}}
        {part "chance" {_still chance} {' {enterOver 2.0 0.4 fadeIn} {_leaves 4.0}}}
        {part "mean" {_still mean} {' {enterOver 4.1 0.5 write} {_leaves 6.0}}}
        {part "example" {_still example} {' {enterOver 4.5 0.4 fadeIn} {_leaves 6.0}}}
        {part "atP"
            {_still atP}
            {' {enterOver 6.2 0.35 write} {emphasize 6.55 6.8 {_point {' "pP"}}} {_leaves 6.7}}}
        {part "own"
            {_still own}
            {' {enterOver 7.0 0.4 fadeIn} {emphasize 8.0 9.0 {_point {' "M" "Mv"}}} {_leaves 9.7}}}
        {part "ownSum" {_still sum} {' {enterOver 7.5 0.4 fadeIn} {_leaves 9.7}}}}]

The reservoirs in a table

Fn([{kept: Int, m: Float, sources: List({light: Int, m: Float, pHat: Float, pHatP: Float, pixel: Int, running: Float, taken: Bool, u: Float, w: Float, weight: Float, wsum: Float}), w: Float, wsum: Float}], Table).
P's and its neighbours' reservoirs: each one's name, its sample, that sample's target at P, its W, its M, and its
weight at P.
$[# {_table c}
    [# header {'
        {caption "hSource" {textKey "combinemath-source"} 0.32 textDimColor}
        {tex "hy" "y" _size targetColor}
        {tex "hpHat" f"{\hat p_P(y)}" _size targetColor}
        {tex "hW" "W" _size estimateColor}
        {tex "hM" "M" _size textColor}
        {tex "hw" "w" _size weightColor}}]
    [# rows {map
        {.sources c}
        {^ {src}
            [# i {.pixel src}]
            {'
                {tex f"{name${str i}}" {nth _names i} _size textColor}
                {tex f"{y${str i}}" {_light {.light src}} _size targetColor}
                {tex f"{pHat${str i}}" {short {.pHatP src}} _size targetColor}
                {tex f"{W${str i}}" {short {.w src}} _size estimateColor}
                {tex f"{M${str i}}" {str {round {.m src}}} _size textColor}
                {tex f"{w${str i}}" {short {.weight src}} _size weightColor}}}}]
    {tableShifted {table "table" {cons header rows} 0.14 textDimColor} {v2 -1.9 1.15}}]

Fn([Table, List(Float), Int], Box). Row `r`'s weight as a bar to the right of the table (`r` from 0, the header
left out), as long as its weight over the largest.
$[# {_barBox t weights r}
    [# top {fold weights 0.000001 max}]
    [# x0 {+ {.x {.hi {nth {nth {.boxes t} 0} 5}}} 0.35}]
    [# y {.y {boxCenter {nth {nth {.boxes t} {+ r 1}} 5}}}]
    {box {v2 x0 {- y 0.16}} {v2 {+ x0 {* 2.4 {/ {nth weights r} top}}} {+ y 0.16}}}]

Fn([Box, Box, Float], Box). A box on its way from `a` to `b`.
$[# {_between a b k} {box {lerp2 {.lo a} {.lo b} k} {lerp2 {.hi a} {.hi b} k}}]

Fn([Table], List(Mob)). The frame before, as a row under the table whose count is far more than thirty-two.
$[# {_before t}
    [# y -1.35]
    [# x0 {.x {boxCenter {nth {nth {.boxes t} 0} 0}}}]
    [# xM {.x {boxCenter {nth {nth {.boxes t} 0} 4}}}]
    [# left {.x {.lo {nth {nth {.boxes t} 0} 0}}}]
    [# right {.x {.hi {nth {nth {.boxes t} 0} 5}}}]
    {flatten {'
        {dashedLine "beforeTop" {v2 left {+ y 0.35}} {v2 right {+ y 0.35}} textDimColor 2.0}
        {moveTo {caption "beforeName" {textKey "combinemath-before"} 0.32 textDimColor} {v2 x0 y}}
        {moveTo {tex "beforeM" f"{\gg ${str _count}}" _size accentColor} {v2 xM y}}}}]

Fn([{kept: Int, m: Float, sources: List({light: Int, m: Float, pHat: Float, pHatP: Float, pixel: Int, running: Float, taken: Bool, u: Float, w: Float, weight: Float, wsum: Float}), w: Float, wsum: Float}], List(ScorePart)).
The reservoirs in a table (stages 11 to 16): its columns written factor by factor, M's column ringed, the frame
before as a row that could stand for far more, the weights as bars laid end to end for the pick, the kept row lit,
the counts added, and W.
$[# {_reuseParts c}
    [# t {_table c}]
    [# n {length {.sources c}}]
    [# weights {map {.sources c} .weight}]
    [# total {fold weights 0.0 +}]
    [# kept {.kept c}]
    [# {_column k} {flatten {map {range 0 {+ n 1}} {^ {r} {cellOf t r k}}}}]
    [# {_tableIn u f}
        [# s {+ 10.0 u}]
        {append
            {create {phase s 10.0 10.3} {.rules t}}
            {flatten {map
                {range 0 6}
                {^ {k} {write
                    {phase s {+ 10.1 {* 0.1 {float k}}} {+ 10.4 {* 0.1 {float k}}}}
                    {_column k}}}}}}]
    [# stripBox {box {v2 -5.5 -1.95} {v2 3.5 -1.65}}]
    [# segments {map
        {strip "pick" weights stripBox {' weightColor [% {rgb "#c4569a"}]} 0.04}
        boxOf}]
    [# {_bars s}
        [# laid {smooth {phase s 13.1 13.6}}]
        {flatten {map
            {range 0 n}
            {^ {r} {filled f"{bar${str r}}"
                {_between {_barBox t weights r} {nth segments r} laid}
                {!if {= {% r 2} 0} weightColor [% {rgb "#c4569a"}]}
                0.85}}}}]
    [# starts {runningSums weights}]
    [# u {/ {lerp {nth starts kept} {nth starts {+ kept 1}} 0.5} total}]
    [# ux {lerp {.x {.lo stripBox}} {.x {.hi stripBox}} u}]
    [# {_pick s}
        [# fall {smooth {phase s 13.6 13.9}}]
        {append
            {arrowLine "pick"
                {v2 ux {lerp -1.1 -1.25 fall}}
                {v2 ux {lerp -1.4 -1.6 fall}}
                accentColor
                3.0}
            {moveTo {tex "pickU" "u" 0.36 textColor} {v2 {- ux 0.3} -1.3}}}]
    [# rowBoxes {nth {.boxes t} {+ kept 1}}]
    [# keptRow {outlined "keptRow"
        {padded {fold {tail rowBoxes} {head rowBoxes} boxUnion} 0.04}
        targetColor
        2.5}]
    [# counts {moveTo
        {texParts "count" f"{\lit{1}{M} = ${join " + " {map {.sources c} {^ {src} {str {round {.m src}}}}}} = \lit{2}{${str {round {.m c}}}}}" _size textColor
            {' "M" "Mv"}
            {' textColor accentColor}}
        {v2 -4.2 -2.75}}]
    [# keptSrc {nth {.sources c} kept}]
    [# w {moveTo
        {texParts "Wfinal" f"{\lit{1}{W} = \frac{\lit{2}{\sum w_i}}{\lit{3}{M}\,\lit{4}{\hat p_P(y)}} = \frac{\lit{5}{${short {.wsum c}}}}{\lit{6}{${str {round {.m c}}}} \cdot \lit{7}{${short {.pHatP keptSrc}}}} = \lit{8}{${short {.w c}}}}" _size textColor
            {' "Wn" "sum" "M" "pHat" "sumV" "MV" "pHatV" "Wv"}
            {' estimateColor weightColor textColor targetColor weightColor textColor targetColor
                estimateColor}}
        {v2 2.9 -2.75}}]
    [# {_ringM t f} {append f {drop {circumscribe t {_column 4} accentColor} {length {_column 4}}}}]
    {'
        {part "keptRow" {^ {s} keptRow} {' {enterOver 13.75 0.25 create}}}
        {part "table"
            {^ {s} {tableFigure t}}
            {' {enterOver 10.0 1.0 _tableIn} {emphasize 11.0 12.0 _ringM}}}
        {part "bars" _bars {' {enterOver 10.75 0.25 {^ {t f} {growFrom t f left}}}}}
        {part "before"
            {^ {s} {_before t}}
            {' {enterOver 12.0 0.4 fadeIn} {exitOver 13.0 0.3 fadeOut}}}
        {part "pick" _pick {' {enterOver 13.6 0.2 fadeIn}}}
        {part "count" {^ {s} counts} {' {enterOver 14.0 0.7 write}}}
        {part "Wfinal" {^ {s} w} {' {enterOver 15.0 0.8 write}}}}]

The scene

Fn([], Score). The reservoirs combined as a score of 16 steps: the weight a neighbour's sample gets at P worked
out, then P's and its neighbours' reservoirs combined in a table.
$[# {_score}
    [# c {exampleCombine _seed _count}]
    {score "combine" 16 {append {_derivationParts c} {_reuseParts c}} {'}}]

The hook

Fn([Float], List(Mob)). The reservoirs combined at stage its stage (`stepOf "combine" 16`, the clips below).
$[# combineMath {: {^ {t} {playScore {_score}}} Math}]

Clips

The scene's steps as clips (lab/src/clip.rs): its demonstration's Play plays every step in order, a second each;
the story plays each over its sentence's words, and sets the scene back to a step where a beat starts.
$[# combineSteps [% {stepsInOrder "combine" 16}]]
